[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0933","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0933.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0630","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000/NT NT Alerter 服务权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 与 Windows 2000 系统中默认运行 NT Alerter（警报器）与 Messenger（信使）服务，二者用于在局域网内发送弹出式管理警报与消息，且无需身份认证即可被远程或本地调用。攻击者在已获取较低权限的本地或网络账户后，可利用这些服务将特制消息发送给目标主机，借助服务以较高权限上下文执行相关操作，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响启用上述服务的 Windows NT/2000 主机，攻击条件为攻击者需先获得目标系统的有效登录凭据或局域网络访问权限，利用方式是通过调用 Alerter/Messenger 服务的接口发送恶意消息以绕过正常权限限制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0630"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:45Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 针对 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 发布的安全补丁 KB189271，并将 Alerter 和 Messenger 服务启动类型设置为\"已禁用\"；若业务必需，可在组策略中通过\"网络安全：LanMan 身份验证级别\"限制远程访问，或关闭 TCP 139、445 端口阻止 net send 消息传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q189/2/71.asp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ef693821096ed2e21366dae590c013e3dc540aa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0630.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0630","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0630.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0630.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vrmc-8g42-jfcf/GHSA-vrmc-8g42-jfcf.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_svc_alerter.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0630.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/smb_svc_messenger.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b10d3823-9a42-4e49-90e2-4307b6b967bb.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0933.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0932","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0932.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0629","title":"UNIX系统 identd服务 信息泄露漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0629 涉及主机 ident/identd 服务的安全配置问题。ident 协议（RFC 1413）允许远程主机查询本地 TCP 连接所对应的系统用户身份。当目标系统运行了 identd 服务且未做适当限制时，攻击者可通过发起本地或远程 TCP 连接并向 ident 端口（113）发起查询，获取与目标连接关联的本地用户名信息。该信息可能被用于用户身份枚举，进而为本地权限提升或针对性攻击（如猜测用户密码、利用用户级漏洞）提供辅助条件。此问题主要影响启用了 identd 服务的类 Unix 系统，攻击前提是对方开放 ident 服务且防火墙未拦截 113 端口，其本身并非可直接利用的代码执行漏洞，而是信息泄露类隐患。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0629"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:45Z","remediation":"在 Linux 系统中执行 `systemctl disable --now identd` 或注释掉 /etc/inetd.conf 中的 auth 行后重启 inetd；若业务必须保留，则通过防火墙仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问 113 端口，禁止外部网络访问该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0629","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0629.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ef693821096ed2e21366dae590c013e3dc540aa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0629.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0629","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0629.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0629.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r25p-h4hw-w7gf/GHSA-r25p-h4hw-w7gf.json","https://github.com/JakeVincet/nvt/blob/f39b9cba98d614dd2a567b15cce1a5eeb97ad782/auth_enabled.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0629.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/linux/gb_ident_inf_disc_vuln.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0932.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0918","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0918.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0625","title":"Unix rpc.rquotad 远程配额服务配置安全隐患漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0625 描述的是主机上 rpc.rquotad 远程磁盘配额守护进程服务处于运行状态的安全配置问题。rpc.rquotad 是 Unix/Linux 系统上用于 NFS 网络文件系统远程磁盘配额管理的 RPC 服务，该协议设计年代较早，未对远程请求实施严格的身份认证与访问控制。当系统启用该服务并使其处于运行状态时，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标主机的 rpc.rquotad 端口发送特制 RPC 请求，获取系统用户的磁盘配额信息，甚至在某些条件下利用该服务进行本地权限提升或作为后续攻击的跳板。该漏洞本质上属于安全配置缺陷而非软件代码漏洞，NVD 将其 CVSS 评分设为 0.0 分（严重级别 LOW）。受影响范围主要为启用了 NFS 服务的 Unix/Linux 主机，攻击者无需事先认证即可在低复杂度条件下完成利用。根据 NVD 评估建议，rpc.rquotad 是一种不安全且已过时的协议，用户应禁用该服务或阻止相关 RPC 端口的网络访问以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0625"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:44Z","remediation":"建议在不需要磁盘配额服务的系统上停止并禁用 rpc.rquotad 服务（如执行 `chkconfig rpc.rquotad off` 并 `kill` 相关进程），或通过防火墙/主机策略限制 111 及 1022 等 RPC 端口仅对受信任内网开放，升级到已默认关闭该服务的 Linux 发行版最新补丁版本（如 RHEL/CentOS 更新 nfs-utils 至厂商最新版）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0625","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d7236390d3d65194e590e3c8620543620af3984/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0625.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0625","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0625.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0625.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r8qg-5ffw-4wgf/GHSA-r8qg-5ffw-4wgf.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0625.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/rpc_rquotad.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0918.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0916","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0916.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0624","title":"SunOS rstat 服务特权提升漏洞","description":"rstat/rstatd 远程统计服务存在权限提升漏洞，该服务在 Unix/Linux 系统中用于远程监控系统性能统计信息（如 CPU 负载、内存使用、磁盘 I/O 等）。攻击者可利用该服务配置不当或权限配置不当的缺陷，通过滥用 rstatd 服务的特权操作获取系统敏感信息或提升权限。该漏洞影响运行 rstatd 服务的 Unix/Linux 系统（如 SunOS、Solaris、Linux 等），攻击者无需认证即可远程访问该服务获取系统敏感统计信息，配合其他漏洞可进一步提升权限至 root 权限。建议禁用不必要的 rstatd 服务或配置严格的访问控制列表限制访问来源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0624"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:44Z","remediation":"建议禁用或卸载系统中不必要的 rstat/rstatd（rstatd 守护进程），通过修改 /etc/inetd.conf 或 systemd 服务配置注释掉 rstatd 相关条目并重启服务，同时使用防火墙限制 772/773/775 等 rpc.rstatd 端口仅允许受信任内网访问，以杜绝该服务暴露带来的信息泄露与权限提升风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0624","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0624.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a23c9152c0ce51f4625e88e1e6abe715ca2d7579/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0624","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0624.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0624.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-44f4-mv9h-2724/GHSA-44f4-mv9h-2724.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/secpod_rpc_rstatd_udp.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0624.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/2011/secpod_rpc_rstatd_tcp.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0916.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0915","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0915.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0623","title":"X.Org X Window System 服务配置不当","description":"CVE-1999-0623 已被 NVD 官方拒绝使用，原因为该候选编号描述的是一个系统配置检查项（X Window 服务正在运行），而非直接构成安全漏洞的缺陷。此类配置检测更适合归入通用配置枚举（CCE）体系管理，不应作为漏洞编号使用。该条目无 CVSS 评分，无有效影响范围与攻击条件说明。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0623"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"若无需图形界面或远程 X11 功能，建议关闭 X Window 服务（如 Linux 下执行 `systemctl stop gdm` 并禁用开机启动）。如需使用 X11 转发，应限制仅监听 127.0.0.1，并通过 SSH 隧道（`ssh -X`）安全转发，避免将 TCP 端口 6000 暴露到外部网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0623.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0623","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0623.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0623.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0623.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0915.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0914","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0914.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0622","title":"通用 DNS 服务配置检测（非安全漏洞）","description":"CVE-1999-0622 已被正式驳回（REJECT），原候选编号描述为\"DNS 相关服务组件正在运行\"。该条目仅涉及系统配置层面的 DNS 服务开放状态，属于安全配置审计范畴而非可直接利用的安全漏洞，不存在攻击路径与利用条件。此类配置信息更适合在通用配置枚举（CCE）中覆盖，不适用作 CVE 漏洞编号。因此该 CVE 不具有实际漏洞意义，不记录 CVSS 评分。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0622"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"配置 DNS 服务时应限制区域传输仅允许授权的辅助 DNS 服务器，关闭递归查询或将其限制为仅内网客户端，防止 DNS 反射放大攻击。同时部署 DNSSEC 保障数据完整性，禁止版本信息泄露，并定期审计 DNS 日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0622.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0622","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0622.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0622.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0622.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/1b758e4b71978ff973a6df1bc69fc70b932735fb/advisories/2000/02/EUVD-1999-0605.json","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0914.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0912","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0912.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0621","title":"Various vendors NETBIOS 组件服务配置不当","description":"该候选编号已被拒绝。原条目仅描述 NETBIOS 相关组件服务处于运行状态，属于安全配置范畴而非可直接引入安全漏洞的缺陷。此类配置问题更适合由通用配置枚举（CCE）覆盖管理，因此该 CVE 编号作废，建议参考 CCE 标准进行安全配置检查。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0621"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP：在网络连接属性中取消选中\"Microsoft 网络的文件和打印机共享\"的绑定，或在高级 TCP/IP 设置中禁用 NetBIOS。在防火墙层面，阻止外部访问 UDP 137-138 和 TCP 139、445 端口。如业务不需要，直接停止 Server 服务并禁用 SMBv1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0621.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0621","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0621.json","https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/blob/c359f282ec6bc3eb6912ee4649970789e923d257/Sample%20Data/Custom/beSECURE_ScanResults_CL.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/netbios_name_get.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0621.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/gitpan/QualysGuard-Request/blob/d9b44790f3fe9c775d3c27df315f23d890890583/t/02-ticket_list.t","https://github.com/opexxx/Metasploit-Unleashed-ebook/blob/c8c7947d4d4a18382b92c12c7ece8573da39c1de/05_vulnerability_scanning/06_working_with_nessus/working_with_nessus.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0621.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0912.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0910","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0910.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0620","title":"NIS 相关服务运行配置问题","description":"该漏洞编号已被 NVD 驳回，原描述为目标系统上运行了 NIS（Network Information System）组件服务。NIS 协议在设计上缺乏加密和认证机制，通过网络在局域网内传输用户账户数据（包括密码哈希）时，处于同一网段的攻击者可进行网络嗅探，捕获 NIS 映射数据后实施离线破解，进而获取系统访问权限。该问题属于安全配置核查范畴，并非传统代码层面的安全漏洞，广泛影响启用 NIS 服务的 Unix/Linux 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0620"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"如业务无需 NIS 服务，应停止 ypserv/ypbind 服务并设置开机不自启：systemctl disable --now ypserv ypbind。如确需使用 NIS，应在 /var/yp/securenets 中限定仅允许受信任子网访问，并避免与互联网直连。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0620.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0620","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0620.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0620.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0620.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv","https://github.com/Software-Engineering-2026-Class/kelompok4-cyber-kg-agentic/blob/0fc3a7d1e2416617ef834c956997e1f0f283424b/parser_agent/output/cve.ttl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0910.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0907","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0907.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0619","title":"通用 Telnet 服务配置不当问题","description":"该候选编号已被拒绝，原描述为\"Telnet 服务正在运行\"。Telnet 协议以明文传输所有数据（包括用户名和密码），未提供任何加密或认证机制，远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探拦截并窃取敏感凭据。此条目属于安全配置问题（不应启用不安全的 Telnet 服务）而非软件漏洞，因此被移入通用配置枚举（CCE）进行管理，建议使用 SSH 等安全替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0619"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"关闭 Telnet 服务（端口 23），改用 SSH（端口 22）进行远程管理。如因兼容性无法禁用，应在防火墙限制 Telnet 的源 IP 访问范围，仅允许受信任的管理网段连接，并启用加密通道（如 stunnel）封装 Telnet 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0619.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0619","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0619.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0619.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/harshsingh4469/endpoint-security-analyzer/blob/39935d29fd093a995963ab16d1953b9224b57717/scanner.py","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000455.txt","https://github.com/SwethaV0611/Network_vuln/blob/fce59788552720e2cf78ee52ee7c584a9475da61/scanner/vulnerability.py","https://github.com/athiasjerome/XORCISM/blob/327e2a3be196660f82c89ae9d7c4e7abe4785b0d/SOURCES/XProviderQualys/QualysSampleResults.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0907.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0904","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0904.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0618","title":"BSD rexec 服务权限提升漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0618是一个针对主机rexec（远程执行）服务的安全漏洞，该服务允许在Unix/Linux系统中进行远程命令执行。此漏洞存在权限提升问题，攻击者可通过向目标主机发送恶意rexec请求，获取更高权限或直接执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有启用rexec服务的主机，包括历史遗留Unix/Linux系统。攻击者无需身份验证即可触发漏洞，利用rexec服务通常具有root权限，一旦被利用，攻击者可完全控制受影响系统。尽管现代操作系统已逐渐废弃此服务，但历史遗留系统仍存在风险。此类权限提升漏洞可能导致系统完全失控，后果非常严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0618"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:44Z","remediation":"立即禁用 rexec 服务：在 Linux/Unix 系统中执行 `systemctl stop rexec && systemctl disable rexec`（或从 inetd/xinetd 配置中注释掉 rexec 行并重启服务）。在 /etc/hosts.equiv 和 .rhosts 文件中移除所有信任条目。使用 SSH（OpenSSH）替代 rexec 进行远程命令执行，确保 `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` 中 `PermitRootLogin` 设为 `without-password` 或 `no`，并禁用 `rhostsRSAAuthentication` 和 `HostbasedAuthentication`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0618","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a23c9152c0ce51f4625e88e1e6abe715ca2d7579/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0618.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0618","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0618.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6d3a932c05085f06507d23e5a0893fa8fe64ce42/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0618.json","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/d9905eb7656178d3e59e0bf8f1d53a9ee9e50186/unittests/scans/openvas/many_vuln.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1ef90eac7bb1a353721fe038daf41872bdff01c4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jw99-fq4j-hx93/GHSA-jw99-fq4j-hx93.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2009/rexecd.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0618.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83127/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0904.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0899","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0899.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0616","title":"TFTP 服务开放导致信息泄露风险","description":"该CVE条目已被官方驳回（REJECT），原描述为\"TFTP服务正在运行\"。TFTP协议使用UDP 69端口，缺乏认证与加密机制，若未配置适当访问控制，运行中的TFTP服务可能被未经授权的攻击者利用进行文件读写操作，导致敏感信息泄露或任意文件上传。但由于该问题属于安全配置范畴而非代码层面的直接安全漏洞，因此不适用CVE编号体系，更适合归入CCE（通用配置枚举）管理。建议在非必要环境中禁用TFTP服务或限制访问来源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0616"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"若业务不需要 TFTP 服务，建议在系统中停止并禁用 tftpd/tftp-hpa 服务（如 `systemctl disable tftp` 或移除 xinetd 配置）。如需使用，通过 iptables/firewalld 限制源 IP 访问 UDP 端口 69，仅允许受信任的管理网段连接，并考虑迁移至 SFTP/SCP 等加密文件传输协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0616.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0616","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0616.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/tftpd_detect.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0616.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000453.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/tftpd_detect.nasl","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/97009c469920f4d8991128f84d19644c3badca15/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-06xx/CVE-1999-0616.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0899.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0896","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0896.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0615","title":"SNMP 服务配置不当漏洞","description":"SNMP 服务在未配置访问控制或使用默认团体字符串时运行，远程攻击者可通过网络探测 UDP 端口 161/162 获取系统信息，包括网络拓扑、运行进程、系统配置和用户账户等敏感数据。该条目已被 NVD 拒绝，理由是此问题属于配置枚举范畴（CCE）而非直接安全漏洞，CVSS 为 0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0615"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2023-11-07T01:54:59Z","remediation":"如非必要，建议在系统服务中禁用 SNMP 服务 (snmpd)，减少攻击面。如需使用 SNMP，应升级至支持 SNMPv3 的版本并启用认证与加密（配置 authPriv），同时通过防火墙限制 UDP 161/162 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理端连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0615.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0615","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0615.json","https://github.com/feng-l