list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0614","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0614.json","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/FTP%20server%20detection.plugin","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0614.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000451.txt","https://github.com/athiasjerome/XORCISM/blob/327e2a3be196660f82c89ae9d7c4e7abe4785b0d/SOURCES/XProviderQualys/QualysSampleResults.xml","https://github.com/Planet-Source-Code/marc-ruef-attack-tool-kit-3-0__1-57240/blob/96061f959b3cf8ad81fa5d603944798cc9f3304c/atk-3.0src/plugins/Macintosh%20OS%20X%20FTP%20server%20detection.plugin"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0895.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0881","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0881.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0602","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10776,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10795}}","description":"网络入侵检测系统（IDS）在处理 IP 分片数据包时存在重组逻辑缺陷，无法正确还原被拆分传输的碎片包。攻击者可将恶意流量拆分为多个分片发送，使攻击载荷绕过 IDS 的特征检测与告警机制，从而在监控盲区中完成入侵行为（如端口扫描或漏洞利用投递）。该漏洞影响当时依赖分片重组能力的各类网络入侵检测产品，攻击条件为攻击者能够向目标网络注入经过分片处理的网络流量，利用方式即构造特制分片包规避检测规则。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0602"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"升级所使用的网络入侵检测系统（如 Snort 升级至 1.6 及以上版本、ISS RealSecure 安装对应补丁）以修复分片重组逻辑；在 IDS  Sensor 配置中启用并正确设置 IP 分片重组（frag2/frag3）模块，合理配置碎片超时与重叠丢弃策略；在网络边界部署支持分片重组检测的防火墙，并启用防分片攻击（如限制异常小分片、丢弃重叠分片）作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.robertgraham.com/mirror/Ptacek-Newsham-Evasion-98.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0602.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0602","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0602.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0602.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cxh-9x8c-5qr7/GHSA-8cxh-9x8c-5qr7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0602.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0602.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eadba179b68570c488f1a812e4ac71e19ff05906/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0881.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0880","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0880.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0601","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16293,\"outputTokens\":37,\"totalTokens\":16330}}","description":"CVE-1999-0601 是指部分网络入侵检测系统（IDS）未能正确解析和校验 TCP 握手阶段（即三次握手 SYN、SYN-ACK、ACK 数据包）中所携带的数据内容。攻击者在建立 TCP 连接时，可在握手报文中嵌入精心构造的载荷，使 IDS 解析异常或漏报，从而绕过入侵检测机制实施隐藏的恶意通信。该漏洞影响未能严格遵循 TCP 协议状态机、对握手阶段数据处理存在缺陷的 IDS 产品，利用条件为攻击者能够与目标网络建立 TCP 连接并向 IDS 镜像流量注入特制握手数据包，属于检测绕过类安全缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0601"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于早期网络入侵检测系统（IDS）对TCP三次握手数据包内载荷的解析缺陷，攻击者可在SYN/ACK等握手报文中夹带恶意数据以绕过检测。修复建议：升级所使用的IDS产品至厂商发布后已修复该缺陷的版本（如早期ISS RealSecure、Snort 1.3及以上等）；若暂无法升级，应在边界防火墙或路由器上启用TCP handshake normalization（如清洗握手包中的异常载荷、强制TCP状态严格校验），并开启IDS的stream重组与握手包深度检测功能以降低绕过风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.robertgraham.com/mirror/Ptacek-Newsham-Evasion-98.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0601.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0601","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0601.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0601.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-45cf-cf6g-j6mm/GHSA-45cf-cf6g-j6mm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0601.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000449.txt","https://github.com/adce626/VULNEX/blob/0040154d93a29bd60c2dcc4038dc3b6c26589646/lib/network-data.ts","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0601.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0880.toml"}]